-- Quantize 4: align four-bar harmonic / density cell; no transport IO.
-- Chosen section: actual single executable checkpoint, not historical header aspirations.
-- Inert m* dropped; silence lanes omitted. Notes/rhythm/gain and existing sends preserved.
-- Orbit-global competing writers removed; all lanes repeat their owner values identically.
